  |= Symbol |= UML Relationship |
  | <color:#333>──▶ solid line</color>  | **Association** (directed) |
  | <color:#333>◆── solid + diamond</color>  | **Composition** (strong, child dies with parent) |
  | <color:#333>◇── solid + hollow</color>  | **Aggregation** (weak, child lives independently) |
  | <color:#333>──▷ solid + triangle</color>  | **Generalization** (extends / inherits) |
  | <color:#333>╌╌▷ dashed + triangle</color>  | **Realization** (implements interface/abstract) |
  | <color:#333>╌╌▶ dashed arrow</color>  | **Dependency** (uses / depends on) |
endlegend

@enduml
